# msim-trace 1
# limits 8,3,200
#
# The ask side holds its three allowed levels. A sell at a fourth price
# would need a new ask level if it rested, but it executes in full against
# the bid at 94, so it never rests and must be accepted.
#
# Found by the differential test against a planted off-by-one in the
# capacity pre-scan (crossing > qty instead of crossing >= qty), and shrunk
# from 2000 commands to these 5.
1 add 1084 S 99 6
2 add 1088 S 97 4
3 add 1089 S 95 9
4 add 1091 B 94 3
5 add 1198 S 94 3
